ity: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n           今年，因缘际会，我们终于有机会可以采购上架了，这两只也门，其中鲁瓦德小农非常的传统日晒类型，能喝到类似中东地区的黑椰枣（或者北方河套地区的沙枣）的那种干的枣带一些些木质纤维的感觉，后段转葡萄干，很甜；巴尼奥菲尔这只是相对偏发酵处理类型的，复杂的发酵提升了豆子的酸质和整体风味的干净和丰富多样性，甚至带来了一些类似贵腐酒甜酒的感觉，巧克力可可的感觉特别像吃到一块莓果味的精品巧克力。\n           <br/>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SWojLYMS4Jbv7nCTXWh09tCjYibgEMcx3em4rL461q6xvib04XvoKakfWYLbK2yR9VXtvUmnbOiaBNw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;visibility: visible !important;width: 676px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 12px;\">\n               新版本的100g没有老的这么闪了，低调内敛了一些～哈哈\n              </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<strong style='outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang